{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33207","headline":"愤惋诗三首 一 · 刘损","name":"愤惋诗三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝钗分股合无缘，鱼在深渊日在天。\n得意紫鸾休舞镜，断踪青鸟罢衔笺。\n金杯倒覆难收水，玉轸倾攲嬾续弦。\n从此蘼芜山下过，祗应将泪比黄泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘损","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}